    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows. Risk-free ~4.2% (US 10y), ERP 5.0%, beta ~0.6 (CME's measured beta is ~0.3-0.5; floored at 0.6 for regulatory/structural risk) -> CoE ~7.2%; debt is ~3% of market cap at ~4.5% pre-tax, so WACC ~7.2%. 7.5% used in every scenario; risk is charged through the scenarios and weights, not by per-scenario WACC.",
